<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-025" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family" source-id="s-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family-ws12827614">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001:m0000" ref="bdx_txf_e62_ABA">垣崇祖</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001:m0004" ref="bdx_txf_e62_ABA">敬遠</persName>，下邳人也。族姓豪彊，石虎世，自略陽徙之於鄴。曾祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001:m0031" ref="bdx_txf_e62">敞</persName>，爲<persName id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001:m0034" ref="van_pwm_swv">慕容德</persName>偽吏部尚書。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001:m0044" ref="bdx_txf_e62_A">苗</persName>，宋武征廣固，率部曲歸降，仍家下邳，官至龍驤將軍、汝南新蔡太守。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-025-yuan-xunzhi-family:p001:m0078" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AB">詢之</persName>，積射將軍，宋孝武世死事，贈冀州刺史。</p>
</text>
